# Not written:
#   rule-10: the source of the rule is in zone vpn-ipsec, and a rule of Google Cloud names no zone: give the networks behind vpn-ipsec with --zone-network
#   rule-11: host name object update-host: the rules are written with addresses
#   rule-13: what it allows cannot be said by a rule of Google Cloud
#   rule-14: not converted: NETMAP on the rule: which addresses its packet filter rule names is not documented; the destination of the rule is in zone vpn-ipsec, and a rule of Google Cloud names no zone: give the networks behind vpn-ipsec with --zone-network
#   rule-7-2: the source of the rule is in zone vpn-ipsec, and a rule of Google Cloud names no zone: give the networks behind vpn-ipsec with --zone-network
#   rule-16: not converted: flag 'MIRROR' is not one FWShift reads
#   rule-9: references 'blocked-region': address 'geoip:XX' is not a form FWShift reads; the destination 'blocked-region' holds members only its platform knows; a rule of Google Cloud names addresses
